# The read must FAIL: Surelog reports the two ILLEGAL lines in dut.sv -- an
# enum with two constants of value 2 (UH0743) and a task port declared WITH
# a data type after a variable of the same name (CP0346).  The exact count
# pins it to those lines: distinct enum values and a variable completed by
# an UNTYPED port must stay silent.
logger -expect error "Surelog reported 0 fatal, 0 syntax and 2 other error" 1
read_sv -nonote -noinfo -nowarning dut.sv
